@Meteo.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5136
@bearerToken = secret-token-1

### Get latest measurement
GET {{Meteo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/current
Accept: application/json

### Get measurement history (last 10 minutes)
GET {{Meteo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/history?from=2026-06-07T00:00:00Z&to=2026-06-07T23:59:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Delete measurement history (example range)
DELETE {{Meteo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/history?from=2026-06-07T00:00:00Z&to=2026-06-07T00:10:00Z
Accept: application/json

### Post calibration data (authenticated)
POST {{Meteo.Api_HostAddress}}/api/calibration
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{bearerToken}}

{
  "temperature": [0.1, -0.2],
  "pressure": [1.0, 0.5]
}
